      "icir": 0.08536,
      "hit_ratio": 0.5390,
      "valid_dates": 1566,
      "average_instruments": 14.994,
      "factor_coverage": 0.475264,
      "rank_turnover": 0.050719,
      "decay_ic": {"5d": 0.00953, "10d": 0.022154, "20d": 0.021273, "40d": 0.019851},
      "max_abs_library_correlation": null
    },
    "regime_notes": "10-day IC for the unreversed recovery score was negative: 2026 -0.196978, 2027 +0.026536, 2028 +0.005093, 2029 -0.056201, 2030 -0.004141, 2031 +0.011245, 2032 YTD -0.058400. Reversal direction passes the absolute daily paper IC and ICIR gates, but regime sign instability and the narrow ICIR margin warrant conservative use.",
